# `git.pull`

Pull (ff-only) in the caller's worktree.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.git.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `workspace_id` | `string?` | no |
| `remote` | `string?` | no |

